<section id="about" class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="about-title" data-section="about">
  <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
  <div class="col">
    <p>
      I'm a student at San José State University, based in San José. I got into this through robots: I competed in FIRST
      Robotics and was president of the BattleBots club at De Anza. These days I work on the software side of the same
      hardware: prosthetic control, neural decoders that have to run on small devices, and checks that catch a model
      when it has quietly stopped working.
    </p>
